  "note": "Accepted with --keep against a flat gate, and the flatness is the evidence: all four local terms and the scoreboard came back bit-identical, which is exactly what the patch predicted, because pivots and sockets are Object3D nodes carrying no geometry. What it fixes is not pixels but honesty. The extremity patch collapsed 30 finger phalanges -- defensibly, a phalanx covers about a pixel at this framing -- and their bones stayed in rig.bones, so the spec asserted 49 bones while the model could skin 19. Probing the built scene found 38 sockets where the interaction pass had exposed 98. A downstream animator reading that spec would bind to joints that move nothing."
